        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n[*] --&gt; MODE_SETTING : MODE_CHANGE from MODE_MANUAL\n\nstate MODE_SETTING {\n  state \&quot;Edit R1\&quot; as Edit_R1\n  state \&quot;Edit Y1\&quot; as Edit_Y1\n  state \&quot;Edit G1\&quot; as Edit_G1\n  state \&quot;Edit R2\&quot; as Edit_R2\n  state \&quot;Edit Y2\&quot; as Edit_Y2\n  state \&quot;Edit G2\&quot; as Edit_G2\n\n  [*] --&gt; Edit_R1\n\n  Edit_R1 : entry/\n  Edit_R1 : Road_2 off, R1 on, active field = R1, temp cfg = curr cfg, draft dur = temp R1\n  Edit_R1 :\n  Edit_R1 : TICK_250MS/\n  Edit_R1 : Toggle R1\n  Edit_R1 :\n  Edit_R1 : INCREASE/\n  Edit_R1 : temp R1++; draft dur = temp R1;\n  Edit_R1 :\n  Edit_R1 : DECREASE/\n  Edit_R1 : temp R1--; draft dur = temp R1\n  Edit_R1 :\n  Edit_R1 : CONFIRM/\n  Edit_R1 : temp cfg.R1 = draft dur;\n\n  Edit_Y1 : entry/\n  Edit_Y1 : Road_2 off, Y1 on, active field = Y1, temp cfg = curr cfg, draft dur = temp Y1\n  Edit_Y1 :\n  Edit_Y1 : TICK_250MS/\n  Edit_Y1 : Toggle Y1\n  Edit_Y1 :\n  Edit_Y1 : INCREASE/\n  Edit_Y1 : temp Y1++; draft dur = temp Y1;\n  Edit_Y1 :\n  Edit_Y1 : DECREASE/\n  Edit_Y1 : temp Y1--; draft dur = temp Y1\n  Edit_Y1 :\n  Edit_Y1 : CONFIRM/\n  Edit_Y1 : temp cfg.Y1 = draft dur;\n\n  Edit_G1 : entry/\n  Edit_G1 : Road_2 off, G1 on, active field = G1, temp cfg = curr cfg, draft dur = temp G1\n  Edit_G1 :\n  Edit_G1 : TICK_250MS/\n  Edit_G1 : Toggle G1\n  Edit_G1 :\n  Edit_G1 : INCREASE/\n  Edit_G1 : temp G1++; draft dur = temp G1;\n  Edit_G1 :\n  Edit_G1 : DECREASE/\n  Edit_G1 : temp G1--; draft dur = temp G1\n  Edit_G1 :\n  Edit_G1 : CONFIRM/\n  Edit_G1 : temp cfg.G1 = draft dur;\n\n  Edit_R2 : entry/\n  Edit_R2 : Road_1 off, R2 on, active field = R2, temp cfg = curr cfg, draft dur = temp R2\n  Edit_R2 :\n  Edit_R2 : TICK_250MS/\n  Edit_R2 : Toggle R2\n  Edit_R2 :\n  Edit_R2 : INCREASE/\n  Edit_R2 : temp R2++; draft dur = temp R2;\n  Edit_R2 :\n  Edit_R2 : DECREASE/\n  Edit_R2 : temp R2--; draft dur = temp R2\n  Edit_R2 :\n  Edit_R2 : CONFIRM/\n  Edit_R2 : temp cfg.R2 = draft dur;\n\n  Edit_Y2 : entry/\n  Edit_Y2 : Road_1 off, Y2 on, active field = Y2, temp cfg = curr cfg, draft dur = temp Y2\n  Edit_Y2 :\n  Edit_Y2 : TICK_250MS/\n  Edit_Y2 : Toggle Y2\n  Edit_Y2 :\n  Edit_Y2 : INCREASE/\n  Edit_Y2 : temp Y2++; draft dur = temp Y2;\n  Edit_Y2 :\n  Edit_Y2 : DECREASE/\n  Edit_Y2 : temp Y2--; draft dur = temp Y2\n  Edit_Y2 :\n  Edit_Y2 : CONFIRM/\n  Edit_Y2 : temp cfg.Y2 = draft dur;\n\n  Edit_G2 : entry/\n  Edit_G2 : Road_1 off, G2 on, active field = G2, temp cfg = curr cfg, draft dur = temp G2\n  Edit_G2 :\n  Edit_G2 : TICK_250MS/\n  Edit_G2 : Toggle G2\n  Edit_G2 :\n  Edit_G2 : INCREASE/\n  Edit_G2 : temp G2++; draft dur = temp G2;\n  Edit_G2 :\n  Edit_G2 : DECREASE/\n  Edit_G2 : temp G2--; draft dur = temp G2\n  Edit_G2 :\n  Edit_G2 : CONFIRM/\n  Edit_G2 : temp cfg.G2 = draft dur;\n\n  Edit_R1 --&gt; Edit_Y1 : SWITCH_LIGHT/\n  Edit_Y1 --&gt; Edit_G1 : SWITCH_LIGHT/\n  Edit_G1 --&gt; Edit_R2 : SWITCH_LIGHT/\n  Edit_R2 --&gt; Edit_Y2 : SWITCH_LIGHT/\n  Edit_Y2 --&gt; Edit_G2 : SWITCH_LIGHT/\n  Edit_G2 --&gt; Edit_R1 : SWITCH_LIGHT/\n}\n\nMODE_SETTING --&gt; [*] : MODE_CHANGE [temp R2 == temp G1 + temp Y1 &amp;&amp; temp R1 == temp G2 + temp Y2] / curr cfg = temp cfg\nMODE_SETTING --&gt; [*] : MODE_CHANGE [else] /\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="SEesWlZide1QGiZT6AZx-28">
